+// Record `r`'s columns as T writes them, hashed: its operator, its operands' records, its value (a wide one field by
+// field), its type's word, facts and class, its operands' conversions, its member offset, its subtree's least record and
+// a call's arguments and their conversions.
+static uint64_t node_shadow_record_hash(const NodeMachine* machine, uint32_t r)
+{
+    const NodeMachineColumns* columns = machine->columns;
+    const uint8_t standing = columns->standings[r];
